# Short, non-aliasing room-four animation probe. It places the camera beside
# the exact enemies being measured, so the captures prove visible pose changes
# as well as the per-tick animation telemetry. The 200 ms capture cadence is
# intentionally not a divisor of the authored 2.5-second idle loops.
fixed_step_ms 50
sample_interval_ms 50
capture_interval_ms 0
max_time_ms 55000
start_time_ms 53033
render_size 1280 720

wait_gameplay 1000
teleport -650 -700 16 1 0 0
wait 500
capture enemy-animation-start
wait 1000
capture enemy-animation-end
assert_health_above 0
finish
